Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第3季第14集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:13.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:57.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄亥俄州 米兰）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:06.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（汽车租赁）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:55.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（好 明天见）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蕾妮 是你吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:11.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（妈妈吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:19.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我昨晚问了你个问题 你考虑好了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我不知道你想要什么）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你当然知道 我想见你）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:39.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我去见你了 去公墓看你了）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:45.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我不是那个意思）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:53.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（但我好怕）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:19:59.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（别怕 我就在这里陪你）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:31.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来我这里）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.75,0:20:41.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来我这里）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:48.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来我这里）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一年活头了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a year to live, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想好好利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to make the most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.33,0:00:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚你的感受 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you feel, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸死了 他留下了个空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's dead, and he left a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你痛苦得难以承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it hurts so bad you can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 再有人问我好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear the next person who asks me if I'm okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要挥拳头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna start throwing punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没办法让我不下地狱 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way of saving me from the pit, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你将变成的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you're gonna become.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.85,0:00:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.77,0:00:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会想办法救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find a way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上解除迪恩的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Dean out of his deal right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.81,0:00:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是推销的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a saleswoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也像其他人一样有老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a boss like everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,合同在谁手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who holds the contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.61,0:00:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了个新红人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a big new up-and-comer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真的很想把萨姆的内脏插在棍子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she really, really wants Sam's intestines on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 萨姆 还有什么我该知道的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, jeez, Sam. Is there anything else I should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琳达 - 我必须跟你说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Linda. - I had to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能总往这里打\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't keep calling here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就…告诉我你考虑过了 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Just tell me you thought about it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么可考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.73,0:01:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:01:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不能 我妻子怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't. My wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你 来我这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you. Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来我这里 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 放过我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会停下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以幸福的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以幸福地在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could be happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.43,0:02:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.18,0:02:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.72,0:02:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不爱我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.53,0:02:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, wait…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the professor doesn't know crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.91,0:04:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,震惊啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 收拾东西 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Pack your panties, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hitting the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄亥俄州有个银行家自己爆头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some banker guy blew his head off in Ohio,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得可能是鬼魂作祟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he thinks there's a spirit involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩在谈案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two were talking a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们是在谈论我们的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we were, uh, we were actually talking about our feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又聊了我们最喜欢的男孩乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then our favorite boy bands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.72,0:04:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们在谈案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we were talking a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼魂吗 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a spirit…? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 有个银行家投诉说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, a banker was complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他家有电力问题 已经一周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}about some electrical problems at his pad for like a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话乱响 电脑闪烁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phones going haywire. Computers flipping on and off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not ringing your bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但迪恩 我们在查案呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean, we're on a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.57,0:04:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真能骗过我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, could have fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.07,0:04:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最近还在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell else have we been doing lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就是在努力帮你打破交易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}other than trying to break your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是在白忙活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chasing our tails, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:05:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我们找遍了本土48州所有的教授 女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we've talked to every professor, witch, soothsayer,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,算命师 甚至是二流马戏团骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and two-bit carny act in the lower 48.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也找不到贝拉 或是柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can't find Bela. We can't find the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们真找到什么之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So until we actually find something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想好好工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to do my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们还有个办法没试过 - 不 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, there's one thing we haven't tried, yet. - No, Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 迪恩 我们该召唤露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Dean, we should summon Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.89,0:05:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再跟你吵这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她知道怎么救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says she knows how to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 你能确定吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really, you know that for sure? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能确定 - 因为她告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - Because she told me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 她告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - She told me…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,直说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}flat out…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本救不了我 没人能\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she could not save me. Nobody can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就忘记对我说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just somehow neglected to mention this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我根本不在乎那贱人怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, I really don't care what that bitch thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不该在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and neither should you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以 - 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So… - So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在还对我有隐瞒了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're keeping secrets from me, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要谈谁对谁有隐瞒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really wanna talk about who's keeping secrets from who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是要去俄亥俄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm going to Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那里发现了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们说说你看到的一切吧 沃特斯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just tell us everything you saw, Mrs. Waters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.74,0:06:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说除了我死去的丈夫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean besides my dead husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说说你看到的其他的一切 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just everything else you saw, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was blood everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.29,0:06:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话被从墙上扯了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The phone was ripped from the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,桌上摆着他最喜欢的威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}his favorite Scotch on the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还想知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else could you possibly wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话为什么被从墙上扯了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was the phone ripped from the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I take a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经跟其他警探都说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already went over all this with the other detectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就离开 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be out of your hair in no time, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 你丈夫什么时候死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, what time did your husband die?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,11点之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometime after 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有奇怪来电吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about strange phone calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,近来有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Receive any of those lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的干扰 静电音 什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird interference, static, anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃特斯太太 对警方隐瞒情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Waters, withholding information from the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是重罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a capital offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这世上某些地方肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}In some parts of the world, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,几周前 有一通…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of weeks ago, uh, there was this…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早上醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up one morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.56,0:07:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到本在书房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard Ben in his study.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他在跟个女人通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was talking to a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他一直喊她琳达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he kept calling her Linda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿起了另一部电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked up the other line and.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.99,0:07:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没人打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}nobody was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,本在对着不存在的人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben was talking to nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.37,0:07:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有静电音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just static.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟本说过这通电话的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever speak to Ben about this phone call?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我该问的 但没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I should've, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.46,0:07:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他说过琳达是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he ever say who Linda was?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有什么要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边根本没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no one on the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达是个美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda's a babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,生前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到她了 - 嗯 琳达·贝特曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find her? - Yeah, Linda Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和本·沃特斯是高中恋人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She and, uh, Ben Waters were high-school sweethearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,被酒驾司机正面撞上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drunk driver hit them head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,本活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 死去恋人打来聊天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what then? Dead flame calls to chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,按说该这么猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但琳达是火化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Linda was cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她的魂怎么还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why is she still floating around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个来电显示呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that, uh, caller ID?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来 那是个电话号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out it's a phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.74,0:08:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没见过那样的电话号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no phone number I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为那是一个世纪前的号码了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, because it's about a century old,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是电话还有手摇柄时的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}from back when phones had cranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么用这个号码来跟人通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why use that number to reach out and talk to someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me there too,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管怎样 我们都该追查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but either way, we should run a trace on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么追查一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how the hell are we gonna trace a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一百多年历史的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's over 100 years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部一般不会派人过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get too many folks from HQ down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 总部提到这里会安排午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, the main office mentioned that there would be a lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定能安排一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure we can arrange something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想找的人就在这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man you gentlemen wanna be speaking to is right this…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 这下面有点卫生问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got something of a hygiene issue down here, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯杜伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stewie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是叫你保持这里干净整洁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you about keeping this place clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spam mail. Spam mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯杜伊·迈耶斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stewie Meyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是坎贝尔先生和雷米先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Campbell, Mr. Raimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这都怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how all this got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.04,0:09:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要满足两位先生的一切需要 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You give these gentlemen whatever they need. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是丰满亚裔美女网吗 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that, uh, BustyAsianBeauties.Com? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me so horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能是吧 - 听我一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - Word to the wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 白金会员 物有所值 - 嗯 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Platinum membership. Worth every penny. - Right, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要追踪个号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to trace a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来电显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off caller ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有些年没用过了 我们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't been used in a few years, we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些年\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few years?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直是史前的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's prehistoric.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相信我 现在没人用这个了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trust me, nobody's using this number anymore. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以还是查查看吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you run it anyway? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先把整个人生都重新安排一下好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I just rearrange my whole life first?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 斯杜伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, uh, Stewie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这里违反了至少六种员工准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got, like, six kinds of employee-code violations down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提你硬盘上装满了令人作呕的色情片\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to mention the sickening porn clogging up your hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搭档叫你查号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my partner says run the number,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.38,0:10:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好赶紧查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you run the number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.19,0:10:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 随便吧 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Whatever. Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy crap. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道号码哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you where the number comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道它打去了哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can tell you where it's been going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两周来有十个住宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten different houses in the past two weeks…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都接到了这个号码的来电\N{\fnArial\fs30}all got calls from the same number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,完事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are we done here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我还忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was sort of busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.42,0:11:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 先生 我是电话公司的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sir. I'm with the phone company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没找电话公司来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't, uh, call the phone company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.05,0:11:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 先生 是我们有事找您\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. No, see, we're calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.93,0:11:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们近来接到了这一带的多宗投诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we've had a lot of complaints from the neighborhood, lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 投诉 - 是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Complaints? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.02,0:11:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂断电话 静电音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropped calls, static.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是电话那头传来奇怪的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even strange voices on the other end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们没有这样的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we haven't had any of that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那好 我们就想来问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, great. Just thought we'd check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 西蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不可能是电话公司的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way you work for the phone company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话公司的人怎么会开租赁汽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when does a phone guy drive a rental or.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿廉价西装\N{\fnArial\fs30}wear a cheap suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们都有秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe we're both keeping secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么问我爸是否在电话上听到了什么奇怪声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you ask my dad if we heard strange voices on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么 你听到什么了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why, did you hear something? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了 还以为你听到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mistake. Thought maybe you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.49,0:12:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 抱歉打扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I would have told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经历过你现在经历的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've been right where you're standing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hearing things,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.93,0:13:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至看到无法解释的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}even seeing things that couldn't be explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I would have been able to help out a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.45,0:13:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我是跟人通过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I've been talking on the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}with…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那并不奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's not so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,死三年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, three years now dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她打来的次数多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How often does she call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周前开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was, like, crazy or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我可以确定地告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can tell you one thing for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna have to go with me on this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这镇上到处有死人给人打电话 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stiffs are calling people all over town. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:13:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚跟个84岁的老奶奶聊过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just talked to an 84-year-old grandmother,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她近来在跟丈夫电话调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's having phone sex with her husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在了朝鲜的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}who died in Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全改变了我对恋尸癖一词的理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Completely rocked my understanding of the word necrophilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么回事啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what the hell's going on here, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 但我们得快点查明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me, but we better find out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方要变成鬼魂中枢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is turning into spook central.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 回头聊 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, I'll call you later. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.31,0:14:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.66,0:14:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think it was Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他听上去什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what did he sound like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.75,0:14:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,像奥普拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Oprah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是爸爸 听上去像爸爸呗 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Dad, he sounded like Dad, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.51,0:14:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 通话中断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the call dropped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要来电啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he even call in the first place, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这镇上为什么有鬼给人打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. Why are ghosts calling anybody in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 有其他人接到亲人的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I mean, other people are hearing from their loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么就不能 这至少是个可能性吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't we? It's at least a possibility, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那或许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so what if…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许真是爸爸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it really is Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他再打来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if he calls back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想到了这个吗 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you come back with? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:15:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,查了三小时 我没发现任何\N{\fnArial\fs30}After three hours, I have found no reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.91,0:16:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方会有超自然现象的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}why anything supernatural would be going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为斯坦福的学历\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you'd think a Stanford education,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上高中完全没泡到过妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a high-school hookup rate of 0.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,会得到更好的结果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}would produce better results than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你找错了地方 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you're just looking in the wrong places, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该去什么地方找呢 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are the right places, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅馆宣传册架\N{\fnArial\fs30}The motel pamphlet rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.76,0:16:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄亥俄州米兰 托马斯·爱迪生的出生地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milan, Ohio. Birthplace of Thomas Edison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是博物馆最独特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we have one of the museum's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.15,0:16:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,最宝贵的珍藏之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}most unique and treasured possessions:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马斯·爱迪生的「鬼魂电话」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas Edison's "spirit phone."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道吗 爱迪生先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that Mr. Edison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是美国最受喜爱的发明家之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}while being one of America's most beloved inventors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还醉心于「神秘学」\N{\fnArial\fs30}was also a devout "occultist"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要打空气引号\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the quote-y fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他花了数年研究这件他最后的发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spent years working on this, his final invention,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.55,0:17:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坚信这台机器可以用来\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he was convinced could be used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟「亡者交流」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"communicate" with the "dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很诡异吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty spooky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续走 继续走 继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're walking. We are walking. We're walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能碰那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're not touching that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续走 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're walking. And stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.11,0:17:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看就是一堆旧破烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}it kind of looks like an old pile of junk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没插电\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even plugged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许不是那么用的 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe it didn't work like that. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许就像个无线电天线塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's like a radio tower, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,向全镇广播死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broadcasting the dead all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.75,0:17:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个来电号码都有百年历史了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the you know, the caller ID is 100 years old, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.50,0:17:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好是这玩意建造出来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right around the time this thing was built.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但它为什么现在突然好用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But why would it all of a sudden start working now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.96,0:17:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.09,0:17:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只要这里还有死人还在给活人打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as long as the moldy are calling the freshes around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.51,0:17:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们能找到的最好的缘由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the best reason we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以或许那真是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe it really is Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么能确定 - 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How can I be sure? - You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能那么做 - 做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- how could you do it? - Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sell your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在照顾萨姆 像你嘱托的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking after Sammy, like you said to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没想要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted this, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我儿子 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my boy. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能眼看你下地狱 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't watch you go to hell, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道要怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.64,0:18:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你破坏交易 萨姆就会死 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you break the deal, Sam dies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我知道条出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Well, I know a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩都能解脱 - 怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For both of you. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个掌握你合约的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon who holds your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.57,0:18:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.99,0:20:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那姑娘蕾妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl, Lanie,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她妈妈的鬼魂昨晚把她吓得不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}her mom's ghost spooked her out pretty bad last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.54,0:21:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得爸爸是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Dad's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.13,0:21:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那恶魔是在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the demon is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.97,0:21:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 气象报告吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, weather reports?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是预兆 恶魔预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omens. Demonic omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.18,0:21:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这两周来一直被雷暴如影随形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electrical storms everywhere we've been for the past two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得看到过雷暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember any lightning storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不记得你小时候研究过气象学呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember you studying meteorology as a kid, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但相信我 那混蛋一直在跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you, that bastard's been tailing me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,用了不知哪个可怜人的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}wearing some poor dude's meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它跟踪你是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's following you because…?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.91,0:21:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是个大猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm big game, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.20,0:21:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,太宝贝了 不想让我脱离视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ass is too sweet to let out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太激动啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get too excited, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拉伤了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might pull something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听着 我也想相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, I wanna believe this, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 那就相信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I really do… - Then believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.50,0:21:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们抓到这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if we get this sucker,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就大功告成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's Miller Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这是另一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.67,0:21:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸说出了一个能杀死恶魔的驱魔仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad rattles off an exorcism that can kill a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是把它送回地狱 还能杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just send it back to hell, but kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.39,0:21:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've checked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是黑暗时代的厉害玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is heavy-duty Dark Ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.77,0:22:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,15世纪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteenth century.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.85,0:22:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也查过了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I checked on it too, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.19,0:22:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比也查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so did Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.19,0:22:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是个驱魔仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}it definitely is an exorcism, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并无证据表明它能杀死恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just no evidence that it can kill a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没证据表明它不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No evidence it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.95,0:22:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之中只有爸爸真去过地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only one of us that's actually been to hell is Dad. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他在下面学会了点招数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he picked up a couple of tricks down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.41,0:22:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如哪种驱魔仪式好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}like which exorcisms work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it does, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望好用 但我们得确定一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I hope it does too, but we just gotta be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么不确定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't we sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不知道这里究竟是什么情况 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't know what's going on around here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人吞枪自尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, some guy blows his brains out,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.22,0:22:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小女孩吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little girl is scared out of her wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 几个平民被鬼吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, a couple of civvies are freaked out by some ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.10,0:22:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 萨姆 人们就是会被鬼吓坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}News flash, Sam, people are supposed to be freaked out by ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸告诉你去哪找那个恶魔了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad tell you where to find the demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.11,0:22:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在等电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting on the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.73,0:22:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉蕾妮我会去看她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Lanie I'd stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.20,0:23:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 不 你去找幼女吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, yeah. No, you go hang out with jailbait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.49,0:23:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心着点克里斯·汉森（钓鱼执法的电视记者）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, watch out for Chris Hansen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.45,0:23:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我会在这里 等着救我自己的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, I'll be here, you know, getting ready to save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are unbelievable, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.63,0:23:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月来 我们一直在努力打破这个恶魔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, for months we've been trying to break this demon deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.51,0:23:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸马上要告诉我们地址了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Dad's about to give us the frigging address,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.13,0:23:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却不肯接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can't accept it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.93,0:23:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都死了 你还跟他对着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's dead and you're still butting heads with the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.85,0:23:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才不是为了这个 - 那是为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not what this is about. - Then what is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.35,0:23:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是 我们没有切实证据 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact is, we got no hard proof here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了这么多 你还是盲目相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything, you're still just going on blind faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.35,0:23:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 或许吧 或许我只有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, maybe. You know, maybe that's all I got, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.70,0:23:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来之前哪都别去 好吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please don't go anywhere until I get back, okay, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.62,0:23:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.77,0:24:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你父亲说过这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told your father about any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.89,0:24:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰他工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bother him at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.19,0:24:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他反正也不会相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't believe me, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.27,0:24:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只会让我去接受治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd just chuck me into therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.61,0:24:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did your mother say?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说想见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she wanted to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,起初 我以为是要我去公墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}So at first I thought I was supposed to go to the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去了吗 - 没发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you? - Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.08,0:24:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但之后 她又要我做别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then she started asking me to do other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.25,0:24:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of things?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.58,0:24:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.81,0:24:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我是西蒙·格林菲尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Simon Greenfield speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.94,0:24:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我想见你 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wanna see you. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.87,0:25:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad? - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那恶魔在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.29,0:25:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾妮 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lanie, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.21,0:25:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我发生了什么 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what happened. It's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.21,0:25:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈叫我去翻爸爸的药柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom told me to go to Dad's medicine cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.22,0:25:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.47,0:25:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,服他的安眠药 他所有的安眠药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take his sleeping pills. Take all his sleeping pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.97,0:25:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要你自杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted you to kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.94,0:25:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈为什么会要我那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would my mom want me to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.02,0:25:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.65,0:25:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了让我去她那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, just so I could come to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.70,0:25:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她要我去她那里 - 不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She wanted me to come to her. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.86,0:25:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她具体怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did she say it exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.45,0:25:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「来我这里」说了好多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Come to me." like, a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.54,0:25:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.46,0:25:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.32,0:26:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 别接电话 别用电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. Don't answer the phone. Don't use the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.78,0:26:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做任何我没叫你做的事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do anything unless I say to, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.87,0:26:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.91,0:26:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Simon?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.51,0:26:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.64,0:27:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's not Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.72,0:27:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 是克洛卡塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then what is it? - A crocotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.35,0:27:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是种三明治吗 - 是种食腐动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That a sandwich? - Some kind of scavenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.27,0:27:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能模仿亲人声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mimics loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.06,0:27:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,低语「来我这里」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whispers, "come to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.14,0:27:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你引入黑暗中 然后吞食你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then lures you into the dark and swallows your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.86,0:27:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,克洛卡塔 好 这就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crocotta, right. Damn, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.48,0:27:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听着 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.61,0:27:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道… - 这玩意生活在脏的地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know… - Don't these things live in filth?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.44,0:27:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 萨姆 电话公司的苍蝇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Sam, the flies at the phone company.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.03,0:28:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是赫曼·蒙斯特 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Herman Munster. Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.91,0:28:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我在停车场 他在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm in the parking lot. He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.83,0:28:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.67,0:28:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.67,0:28:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你是什么 - 等等 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know what you are. - Wait, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.55,0:28:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也知道怎么杀了你 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I know how to kill you. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.63,0:28:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.01,0:28:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们多收了你的呼叫等待费用什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're overcharging you for the call waiting or something, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.14,0:28:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可以解决 我是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fix that, I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:29:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Just… Just don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.10,0:29:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀我 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kill me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.65,0:29:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.52,0:29:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫你敢惹电话公司 蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happens when you mess with the phone company, dillweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.20,0:29:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.53,0:29:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.08,0:29:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I'm sorry, Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.22,0:29:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我对你做了什么 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for whatever I did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.05,0:29:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 求你 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. Please… - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.56,0:29:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.27,0:29:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.10,0:29:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是个杀手 克拉克 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a killer, Clark. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.69,0:29:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里有个好人的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good man inside of you. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.07,0:29:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.36,0:29:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个好人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I a good man?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.07,0:29:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.70,0:30:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.20,0:30:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真挺想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really would.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.50,0:30:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我中午只吃了份沙拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only I'd had more than a salad for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.37,0:30:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.42,0:30:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.50,0:30:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.04,0:30:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后跟道恩的那通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}My last call with Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.91,0:30:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.83,0:30:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我引来了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You led me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.34,0:30:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会打电话 也会接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some calls I make, some calls I take.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.97,0:30:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.72,0:31:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我骗过了你一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had you fooled for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.01,0:31:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱迪生那台电话的鬼扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that Edison phone crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.10,0:31:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.11,0:31:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.28,0:31:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在杀你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm killing your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.24,0:31:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也或者我是在杀另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I'm killing another guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.58,0:31:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得等着瞧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just have to see how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.38,0:31:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.56,0:31:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.55,0:31:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.22,0:31:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说你不会再打来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you weren't gonna call anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.52,0:31:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.56,0:31:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这让老爸多难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how sad this makes your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:31:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你葬礼上多难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}How upset I was at your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.11,0:32:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须打来 我知道是谁杀了我 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to call. I know who killed me, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.87,0:32:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.32,0:32:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀我的男人 他现在就在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who killed me. He's at the house right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.10,0:32:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you saying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.75,0:32:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在家里呢 爸爸 他还想杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's at the house, Daddy. He wants to kill you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.64,0:32:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,模仿迪恩是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, mimicking Dean's one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.02,0:32:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.68,0:32:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a hell of a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.14,0:32:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一发现你俩是猎人 就很简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, once I made you two as hunters, it was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.07,0:32:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到了迪恩的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found Dean's number…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.99,0:32:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是你的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}then your number,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.61,0:32:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是你爸爸的几个号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}then your father's numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.86,0:32:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有电邮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then to e-mails,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.87,0:32:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,语音信箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}voice mails.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.95,0:32:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.95,0:32:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们以为那些东西会被抹去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, people think that that stuff just gets erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.83,0:32:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.04,0:32:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised at.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.09,0:32:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多少信息散落在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much of yourself is just floating out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.84,0:33:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着被提取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting to be plucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.51,0:33:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩不会上当的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's not gonna fall for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.10,0:33:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会杀了那人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna kill that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.22,0:33:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么那人便会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the guy kills him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.11,0:34:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.18,0:34:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让生活简便多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes life so much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.65,0:34:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前 我要在林子里藏几天 几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be I'd hide in the woods for days, weeks…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.36,0:34:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对人低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}whispering to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.36,0:34:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把他们从黑夜里引出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to draw them out into the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.33,0:34:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们有社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they had community.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.08,0:34:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们彼此照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all looked out after each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.87,0:35:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一年能吃一两个灵魂就算走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be lucky to eat maybe one, two souls a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.04,0:35:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我饿了时 我只需要打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now when I'm hungry, I simply make a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都连接在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all so connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.51,0:35:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却前所未有的孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've never been so alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.76,0:35:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.93,0:35:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.69,0:36:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我女儿也这么做了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this to my daughter too?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.52,0:36:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么走出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.07,0:36:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我女儿也这么做了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do this to my daughter too?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.28,0:36:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这是搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. This is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.28,0:36:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.45,0:36:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 等等 - 你杀了她 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Wait. - You killed her, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.65,0:36:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她才九岁 - 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was 9 years old! - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.99,0:36:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.49,0:36:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.37,0:37:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.92,0:37:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没杀你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.67,0:37:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.56,0:37:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.78,0:37:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们改善了你的脸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see they improved your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.47,0:37:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.96,0:37:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,克洛卡塔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So crocotta, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.17,0:37:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.29,0:37:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得有苍蝇呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would explain the flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.38,0:37:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.89,0:37:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry it wasn't Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.47,0:38:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我这次对你态度好差\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I gave you a hell of a time on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.23,0:38:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.81,0:38:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.02,0:38:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.32,0:38:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太想相信这事还有出路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to believe so badly that there was a way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.78,0:38:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是穷途末路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm staring down the barrel at this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.91,0:38:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.66,0:38:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真格的 永不得翻身 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real, forever. And I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.25,0:38:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好怕 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm scared, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.05,0:38:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的好怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.39,0:38:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.85,0:38:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概是愿意相信一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I was willing to believe anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.69,0:38:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝望之人的最后一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, last act of a desperate man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.90,0:38:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有希望没什么不对 迪恩 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's nothing wrong with having hope, Dean. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.69,0:38:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不能让你得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope doesn't get you jack squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:38:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能指望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.65,0:38:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸会在最后时刻带着奇迹出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad to show up with some miracle at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.82,0:39:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能指望任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't expect anybody to, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能帮我脱身的就是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only person that can get me out of this thing is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.88,0:39:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.17,0:39:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「还有我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.34,0:39:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.22,0:39:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾吐内心 气氛刚刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep revelation, having a real moment here,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.01,0:39:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想到了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what you come back with?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.93,0:39:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「还有我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.97,0:39:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我写诗吗 - 那气氛过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want a poem? - Moment's gone.
